     "value": "Mitochondrial protein involved in the maturation of mitochondrial [4Fe-4S]-proteins in the late stage of the iron-sulfur cluster assembly pathway (PubMed:22323289, PubMed:23462291). Operates in cooperation with ISCA2 in the maturation of [4Fe-4S] proteins (PubMed:30269484)"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "evidences": [
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "23462291"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Involved in the maturation of mitochondrial 2Fe-2S proteins in the late stage of the iron-sulfur cluster assembly pathway"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "evidences": [
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
