       "id": "30269484"
      },
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "31831856"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Monomer (PubMed:31831856). Heterotetramer; forms a dimer of dimers with ISCA2 (PubMed:31831856). Interacts with [2Fe-2S]-ISCA2 forming the heterodimer [2Fe- 2S]-ISCA2-IBA57 complex; [2Fe-2S] cluster binding is absolutely required to promote the complex formation (PubMed:30269484)"
    }
   ],
